# Wave W17-AB (Route 225): zone post — a training-ground marker post on the hard road: a weathered post carrying a plain CROSSBAR at its head, the Battle Zone’s own punctuation — a marker you train against, set where the road’s verge firms up (design: everything out here trains, including the weather; the posts are the road’s training furniture). On scorch turf (fully opaque, ground baked in) — split from the fleet’s marker posts by the bar entire: posts mark a road, this one marks a ground you work on.
